{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1e5262574ae80babe3f511539e5876c8a6270d2afb102599dd2f1d5ac4318e3f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"atmosphere/atmosphere@468f0ea79d57 snapshot 0d4003c8c705d782","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b2624843ed2eced2c7c09734a0e3cb48bfaaa2519b1dc5124981e42eff755ec0"],"source_ids":["src_53f2e9b934f0535a927d22c15844d65b"],"text":"Multi-agent orchestration uses @Coordinator and AgentFleet with handoffs, conditional routing, an event-sourced coordination journal, and durable hibernating Workflow<S> over a CheckpointStore (optionally Temporal-backed).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4bd65132a66b7da93119254b1974d747dc1adb365c6872079484679e86bba8d3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"atmosphere/atmosphere@468f0ea79d57 snapshot 0d4003c8c705d782","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0af88de3f6b01d1945aa13828592d9eb4f00283cfcc8d64cd8bb071199798d97","slc_791ea5e6620fcf131fab0a38e3a67bbcdb6d3d6616e25e9d6141f24072c99bb7","slc_c14e72681cea900128669fad73dad79a248e14ce35923d59abfc943aeecb691a"],"source_ids":["src_9db5e1e0c09e55db8dadc410127116db"],"text":"Repository development practice: git hooks must be enabled via core.hooksPath .githooks each session; they enforce copyright headers, no unused imports, commit format, and no AI-generated commit trailers, and --no-verify is forbidden.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_59e1042ef9426e125d9916612293db078e2cb6e1258ba03a124b50767486c5c8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"atmosphere/atmosphere@468f0ea79d57 snapshot 0d4003c8c705d782","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1076fd185a670b0eb736f4b3c9cfab956a7f852dfb32d38eda645f53eea84055","slc_79d69a2407908bb49b5805557633d46d1dcaf30ba0fe5496fd38be498530c064"],"source_ids":["src_53f2e9b934f0535a927d22c15844d65b"],"text":"The CLI can import agent skill files, e.g. atmosphere import of an Anthropic SKILL.md URL, and a companion atmosphere-skills repository offers curated skill files.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6bcef9d731bbe2026b8a197c2d7cfb552b7356f3a7787bafcc153e10c2271495","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"atmosphere/atmosphere@468f0ea79d57 snapshot 0d4003c8c705d782","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_93a31e11c17687385c3ca6b404185ae2d5a78ecce2ae47014858ab587335c80e"],"source_ids":["src_53f2e9b934f0535a927d22c15844d65b"],"text":"Runtime adapter capabilities are pinned by AbstractAgentRuntimeContractTest.expectedCapabilities(), so a runtime cannot drift from its declared feature set without breaking tests.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_866dbf102562ab740b8c8ed962d16fcd651a2a2ca03d871ac77d80fc8d80b761","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"atmosphere/atmosphere@468f0ea79d57 snapshot 0d4003c8c705d782","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ae38f3ce8172039e99a8187636c26d8c79ad5cf9336bc57eed8872a018d3be2f"],"source_ids":["src_53f2e9b934f0535a927d22c15844d65b"],"text":"Governance controls include GovernancePolicy/PolicyRing with allow/deny lists and rate limits, @AgentScope purpose enforcement, tool approval policies, and a plan-and-verify verifier module.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9495451c2824285e4cdf93b4cf5acbadfd3df68688b1febe8f9c0a066640d41b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"atmosphere/atmosphere@468f0ea79d57 snapshot 0d4003c8c705d782","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_06e99b0388a5a1ba339937cbbf2327daac2e60d5f9ead618c7b684fc460452ab"],"source_ids":["src_53f2e9b934f0535a927d22c15844d65b"],"text":"The atmosphere-ai module ships an AgentRuntime SPI with a built-in OpenAI-compatible adapter; eleven more adapters live in separate modules, two of which (Anthropic, Cohere) are native HTTP+SSE clients.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:35:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_615a9bfb9eb04510b239fa726de6b5c5"}
